Version control system
central VCS - Distributed VCS
we can work offline
every user will have a working copy called local repository

git is widely used in enterprises

git commands

git init -- initialize git 
git add file or . or *
git commit -m "message"

git stash --to save the file temprorly
git stash list
git stash pop - pop will remove the stash content
git stash apply - will keep the stash content
we can add stash id to pop or apply stash

git branch
git checkout <branch name>
git branch <new branch>
 
git push origin branch
git pull

git fetch -- fetch will only get the changes from remote but will not merge

git merge branch  ----- this will merge from the given branch to the current branch

git remote add origin <url>

git clone <url>

